    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) right after one of your **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** units finishes a **Charge move**; that unit is the target.\n\n1. You may spend 2 Yield Points (2YP) on this use.\n2. Pick 1 enemy unit (not **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**) in **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of that **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** unit.\n3. Roll a D6 per model in the **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** unit, plus 2 more D6 when YP were spent on this use.\n4. Each 4+ deals 1 **mortal wound** to the enemy unit, up to 6 in total.",
